<title>SINGAPORE: Hotel Grand Central first half down.</title>
<headline>Hotel Grand Central first half down.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1996-09-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30, 1996</p>
<p>(in millions of Singapore dollars unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit		    3.32   vs  6.42</p>
<p>    Group shares (cents)	1.81   vs  3.50</p>
<p>    Turnover		     22.53   vs 15.77</p>
<p>    Interest			4.02   vs  2.57</p>
<p>    Pretax			  3.60   vs  6.58</p>
<p>    Associates		    1.41   vs  2.62</p>
<p>    Tax			     1.58   vs  2.45</p>
<p>    Minorities		   (0.11)  vs (0.32)</p>
<p>Note- Full name is Hotel Grand Central.</p>
<p>Singapore Newsroom 65-8703080</p>
